// Welcome
"welcomeTitle" = "Welcome aboard! 🎉";
"welcomeText" = "%@, this is your space for stories. Save bright moments, tag friends, and share memories when you meet.\n\nYou know that feeling when you're scrolling through your phone gallery and suddenly stumble upon a photo that takes you back to a long-forgotten moment? Memories that seemed lost somewhere deep in your mind suddenly come alive!\n\nThis app was made exactly for that. Save more happy moments, collect them as stories, and revisit them together with friends.";

