// Help
"helpExchangeTitle" = "Story Exchange";
"helpAddFriendTitle" = "Adding a Friend";
"helpExchangeBlock1" = "**Meet your friend**\nTo share stories you need to *physically* be near your friend.\n\nDon't worry if you couldn't share a story right after writing it. Stories love being remembered a bit later";
"helpExchangeNote1" = "You don't need to bring phones close together, being within 10-15 meters is enough";
"helpExchangeWarning1" = "If you bring phones too close — *Apple AirDrop* will activate and you'll exchange contacts, that's not what we need";
"helpExchangeBlock2" = "Press the data transfer buttons **simultaneously**";
"helpExchangeNote2" = "You don't need to press at the exact same second, a gap of 8-10 seconds is fine";
"helpExchangeBlock3" = "**Wait for the story exchange**";
"helpExchangeNote3" = "If the connection was lost, go back to the friend screen and try exchanging stories again";
"helpAddBlock1" = "To tag a friend in stories you need to add them to your friends list";
"helpAddNote1" = "Don't worry, to start writing shared stories your friend doesn't need to be nearby. They don't even need to download the app";
"helpAddBlock2" = "**If your friend is not nearby** \n\n 1.  Press \"Add Friend\" and select \"Create Friend Profile\"\n 2.  Enter name and choose a color\n 3.  **Great!** From now on you can tag this friend in your stories\n\n 4.  When you meet, simultaneously press \"Share Stories\" in the created profile\n 5.  Wait for the data exchange to complete";
"helpAddNote2" = "After this, the friend profile you created will be linked to the profile created by your friend";
"helpAddBlock3" = "**If your friend is nearby** \n\n 1.  Press \"Add Friend\" and select \"Get Friend Profile\"\n 2.  Your friend should also press \"Get Friend Profile\" or \"Share Stories\" if they already created your profile\n 3.  Wait for synchronization\n 4.  **Great!** From now on you can tag this friend in your stories\n";
"helpAddWarning" = "If the friend wasn't found during search, you can go back and press \"Get Friend Profile\" again";

